## 為電子商務網站打造前端界面的完整流程

下面的步驟將帶你從零開始，從設計到實現、測試、部署，最終把一個乾淨、響應式且易於維護的前端交付給用戶。

| 步驟 | 目標 | 具體做法 | 工具 / 技術 |
|------|------|----------|--------------|
| 1. 需求分析 & 用戶研究 | 確定功能需求、目標客群、使用場景 | - 產品列表、分類、搜索<br>- 商品詳情頁<br>- 購物車、結帳流程<br>- 用戶賬號、訂單歷史<br>- 行動裝置友好 | Google Analytics、Hotjar、用戶訪談 |
| 2. 設計 UI/UX | 視覺風格、互動設計、信息架構 | - 低保真原型（紙上或 Figma）<br>- 高保真設計（色彩、字體、圖標）<br>- 交互動畫、過渡效果 | Figma / Sketch / Adobe XD |
| 3. 選擇技術棧 | 前端框架、狀態管理、樣式解決方案 | - **React** + **Next.js**（SSR/SSG）<br>- **Vue** + **Nuxt.js**<br>- **Angular**<br>選擇取決於團隊熟悉度與 SEO 需求 | React, Vue, Angular, Next.js, Nuxt.js |
| 4. 建立項目結構 | 可維護、可擴展 | ```bash\nnpx create-next-app ecommerce-frontend\n```<br>或 `vue create` / `ng new` | Next.js CLI / Vue CLI / Angular CLI |
| 5. 样式与主题 | 响应式、可自定义主题 | - CSS-in-JS（styled-components, Emotion）<br>- Tailwind CSS（原子化类）<br>- Sass/SCSS | styled-components, Emotion, Tailwind, Sass |
| 6. 路由与页面 | 页面导航、懒加载 | - Next.js 的文件系统路由<br>- Vue Router / Angular Router | Next.js, Vue Router, Angular Router |
| 7. 状态管理 | 全局状态、购物车、用户信息 | - Redux Toolkit / Zustand / Recoil（React）<br>- Pinia / Vuex（Vue）<br>- NgRx（Angular） | Redux Toolkit, Pinia, NgRx |
| 8. 与后端 API 对接 | 数据获取、身份验证 | - Axios / Fetch<br>- GraphQL（Apollo Client）<br>- JWT / OAuth2 | Axios, Apollo Client |
| 9. 表单与验证 | 搜索、登录、结账表单 | - Formik / React Hook Form<br>- VeeValidate / Vue Formulate | Formik, React Hook Form, VeeValidate |
| 10. 性能优化 | 加速首屏、懒加载、缓存 | - Image Optimization（next/image）<br>- Code Splitting<br>- Service Workers | next/image, Webpack, Workbox |
| 11. 测试 | 单元、集成、E2E | - Jest + React Testing Library / Vue Test Utils<br>- Cypress / Playwright | Jest, React Testing Library, Cypress |
| 12. CI/CD & 部署 | 自动化构建、部署 | - GitHub Actions / GitLab CI<br>- Vercel / Netlify / Render | GitHub Actions, Vercel |
| 13. SEO & Analytics | 搜索引擎友好、数据追踪 | - Meta tags, Open Graph<br>- Google Tag Manager, GA4 | Next.js Head, react-helmet |

---

## 代码示例：React + Next.js + Tailwind + Redux Toolkit

### 1️⃣ 初始化项目

```bash
npx create-next-app@latest ecommerce-frontend --typescript
cd ecommerce-frontend
npm install tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
```

在 `tailwind.config.js` 添加：

```js
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./pages/**/*.{ts,tsx}",
    "./components/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

在 `globals.css` 引入 Tailwind：

```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
```

### 2️⃣ Redux Toolkit 设置

```bash
npm i @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux
```

创建 `store.ts`：

```ts
import { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';
import cartReducer from './slices/cartSlice';

export const store = configureStore({
  reducer: {
    cart: cartReducer,
  },
});

export type RootState = ReturnType<typeof store.getState>;
export type AppDispatch = typeof store.dispatch;
```

创建 `cartSlice.ts`：

```ts
import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';

interface CartItem {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  price: number;
  quantity: number;
}

interface CartState {
  items: CartItem[];
}

const initialState: CartState = { items: [] };

const cartSlice = createSlice({
  name: 'cart',
  initialState,
  reducers: {
    addToCart(state, action: PayloadAction<CartItem>) {
      const existing = state.items.find(i => i.id === action.payload.id);
      if (existing) {
        existing.quantity += action.payload.quantity;
      } else {
        state.items.push(action.payload);
      }
    },
    removeFromCart(state, action: PayloadAction<string>) {
      state.items = state.items.filter(i => i.id !== action.payload);
    },
    clearCart(state) {
      state.items = [];
    },
  },
});

export const { addToCart, removeFromCart, clearCart } = cartSlice.actions;
export default cartSlice.reducer;
```

在 `_app.tsx` 包装 Redux Provider：

```tsx
import { Provider } from 'react-redux';
import { store } from '../store';

function MyApp({ Component, pageProps }) {
  return (
    <Provider store={store}>
      <Component {...pageProps} />
    </Provider>
  );
}

export default MyApp;
```

### 3️⃣ 页面示例：产品列表

```tsx
// pages/index.tsx
import { useEffect, useState } from 'react';
import axios from 'axios';
import { useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { addToCart } from '../slices/cartSlice';

interface Product {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  price: number;
  image: string;
}

export default function Home() {
  const [products, setProducts] = useState<Product[]>([]);
  const dispatch = useDispatch();

  useEffect(() => {
    axios.get('/api/products').then(res => setProducts(res.data));
  }, []);

  const handleAdd = (product: Product) => {
    dispatch(addToCart({ ...product, quantity: 1 }));
  };

  return (
    <div className="container mx-auto p-4">
      <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">商品列表</h1>
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {products.map(p => (
          <div key={p.id} className="border rounded p-2 flex flex-col">
            <img src={p.image} alt={p.title} className="h-48 object-cover mb-2" />
            <h2 className="font-semibold">{p.title}</h2>
            <p className="text-gray-600">${p.price.toFixed(2)}</p>
            <button
              onClick={() => handleAdd(p)}
              className="mt-auto bg-blue-500 text-white py-1 px-3 rounded hover:bg-blue-600"
            >
              加入購物車
            </button>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 4️⃣ 购物车组件

```tsx
// components/Cart.tsx
import { useSelector, useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { RootState } from '../store';
import { removeFromCart, clearCart } from '../slices/cartSlice';

export default function Cart() {
  const items = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.cart.items);
  const dispatch = useDispatch();

  const total = items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.quantity, 0);

  return (
    <div className="p-4 border rounded">
      <h2 className="font-bold mb-2">購物車</h2>
      {items.length === 0 ? (
        <p>購物車空空如也。</p>
      ) : (
        <>
          <ul>
            {items.map(item => (
              <li key={item.id} className="flex justify-between py-1">
                <span>{item.title} × {item.quantity}</span>
                <span>${(item.price * item.quantity).toFixed(2)}</span>
                <button
                  onClick={() => dispatch(removeFromCart(item.id))}
                  className="text-red-500 ml-2"
                >
                  X
                </button>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <div className="mt-4 font-semibold">總計: ${total.toFixed(2)}</div>
          <button
            onClick={() => dispatch(clearCart())}
            className="mt-2 bg-red-500 text-white py-1 px-3 rounded hover:bg-red-600"
          >
            清空購物車
          </button>
        </>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 5️⃣ API 示例（Next.js API 路由）

```ts
// pages/api/products.ts
import type { NextApiRequest, NextApiResponse } from 'next';

export default function handler(req: NextApiRequest, res: NextApiResponse) {
  const products = [
    {
      id: '1',
      title: 'Apple iPhone 15',
      price: 999,
      image: '/images/iphone15.jpg',
    },
    // ...更多商品
  ];
  res.status(200).json(products);
}
```

